WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.650
The workflow lints clean,
with every action pinned.

3
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.529
The app signs in with a federated
credential and nothing stored,

4
00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:12.262
holds only the reads it needs,
and the cloud settings all agree.

5
00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:14.849
Reading and writing stay in separate jobs.

6
00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:20.300
Findings from a failed check stay open,
and issues carry identifiers, not names.

7
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:25.292
Every package verifies with a standard tool
and chains to the one before, retention

8
00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:29.850
is locked in production, and someone
checks every day that a package arrived.

9
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.075
That's the last chapter of the workbook.

10
00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:33.240
Thanks for watching.
